cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
output.1	1	converter	convert					the output writes the relations as one MTSV file, at its levels file, sheet, record and field
output.2	1	converter	sheets					output gives sheet's sheets as its own: each relation's sheet, named and with its header, in the order of places
output.3	1	converter	convert					the file is written by the generator: an FF line before the sheet, a line break after every record
